            "subtitle": "Rounder tummy,  slim hips and legs",
            "features_list": "<li>Focus on elongating your frame with vertical lines and high waistlines</li><li>Draw attention upward toward your neckline and décolletage</li><li>Let the fabric flow past the midsection rather than clinging to it</li><li>Highlight your gorgeous legs with shorter hemlines or high slits</li>",
