      "name": "Pro Size Guide",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Find Your Best Fit",
        "description": "This size chart serves as a helpful reference. To get the ideal fit, match your body measurements to our size chart and follow the measuring guide.",
        "how_to_title": "How to Measure",
        "measure_image": "shopify://shop_images/size-1.jpg",
        "measure_text": "<p><strong>Bust:</strong> Measure under your arms around the fullest part of your bust. Keep the measuring tape level.</p><p><strong>Waist:</strong> Measure around the narrowest part of your natural waist. Keep the tape comfortably fitted, not too tight.</p><p><strong>Hips:</strong> Stand with your feet together and measure around the widest part of your hips.</p><p><strong>Hollow to Floor: </strong>Stand straight with your feet together and measure barefoot from the hollow space between your collarbones straight down to the floor.</p><p><strong>Height, Barefoot:</strong> Stand straight with your feet together and measure barefoot from the top of your head straight down to the floor.</p><p><strong>Armhole: </strong>Down the front of the shoulder, under the armpit, and up the back of the shoulder.</p><p><strong>Arm Length: </strong>Measure from your shoulder point to the wrist.<br/></p>",
        "footer_note": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> This guide is a general reference. Sizing and fit vary with dress styles. If you have questions about a specific product measurements, please feel free to <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a>.</p>"
      }
